# Contact form: messages are sent to abhi96anand@gmail.com via Formspree
# 1. Go to https://formspree.io and sign up with abhi96anand@gmail.com
# 2. Create a new form (it will send submissions to that email)
# 3. Copy the form ID from the form endpoint (e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xyzabc → xyzabc)
# 4. Create a file .env in this folder and add:
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=your_formspree_form_id_here
